    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Maryanne Emomeri a dedicated professional deeply committed to media relations and advocacy for the disability community, discovered a pivotal opportunity in the Media Relations Training Programme at GSMC. She initially saw it as a chance to hone her skills and amplify the voices of people with disabilities. What she didn't anticipate, however, was the profound transformation it would bring to her understanding of media engagement.",
